<div id="smallButtons" class="sg__header3">Small Buttons</div>
<p>A button can be made smaller by adding either a helper class or a mixin.</p>
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Small Button</button>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 pt-2 pb-3 pt-md-0 pb-md-0">
        <pre><code class='language-markup'><script type="text/plain" class="language-markup"><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Small Button</button></script></code></pre>
        <pre><code class='language-css'><script type="text/plain" class="language-css">.element {
    @include button(primary, null, null, null, small);
}</script></code></pre>
    </div>
</div>